The bundled Linux kernel is built from the Tizen 10.1 RPi4 Linux 6.12.41
source RPM, including its Tizen patches. The source retains the individual
copyright notices of the Linux and Tizen contributors.

Linux is distributed under the GNU General Public License version 2.
On Ubuntu the license text is available in /usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-2.

Corresponding kernel source RPM:
https://github.com/hjhun/tizen-ornn/releases/download/10.1-r4/rpi4-linux-kernel-6.12.41-0.src.rpm

The host package includes the kernel build script (with the source RPM
SHA-256 and Tizen source revision), configuration fragment and final kernel
configuration in /usr/lib/tizen-ornn/scripts/build-kernel.sh and
/usr/lib/tizen-ornn/kernel/.
